00:08:04.214 --> 00:08:06.292
Absolutely, and so you
gotta keep an eye on it.

00:08:06.292 --> 00:08:07.354
You can't take your ball off.

00:08:07.354 --> 00:08:09.440
But I just think the world's better.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.396
And the internet--
- Yeah.

00:08:10.396 --> 00:08:12.719
- Doesn't care that you crossed the border

00:08:12.719 --> 00:08:13.552
and started a business.

00:08:13.552 --> 00:08:15.401
The internet is fuckin' the best.

00:08:15.401 --> 00:08:16.234
- Yeah.

00:08:17.414 --> 00:08:18.711
- My point of view.

00:08:18.711 --> 00:08:20.763
- I can't even imagine
the people that grew up

00:08:20.763 --> 00:08:23.511
that didn't have, you
know, like how we grew up.

00:08:23.511 --> 00:08:25.061
We didn't have the internet--

00:08:25.061 --> 00:08:25.894
- We were 18!

00:08:25.894 --> 00:08:26.727
- Yeah, yeah.

00:08:26.727 --> 00:08:28.144
- We lived our whole--

00:08:28.144 --> 00:08:29.117
