00:08:43.767 --> 00:08:46.321
People don't, these
youngsters don't get it.

00:08:46.321 --> 00:08:47.154
- Yeah.

00:08:47.154 --> 00:08:50.431
- I'm just, I'm unbelievably struggling

00:08:50.431 --> 00:08:52.286
