00:09:03.363 --> 00:09:06.845
I mean, if that's your
life, you fuckin' won.

00:09:06.845 --> 00:09:07.678
- Yeah.

00:09:07.678 --> 00:09:09.599
Yeah, first world problems.

00:09:09.599 --> 00:09:10.502
- Not even.

00:09:10.502 --> 00:09:11.335
- Yeah.

00:09:11.335 --> 00:09:12.181
- $6 coffee.

00:09:12.181 --> 00:09:13.512
- Let's talk about your book.

00:09:13.512 --> 00:09:14.345
- Yeah.

00:09:14.345 --> 00:09:15.348
