00:09:15.348 --> 00:09:16.181
- Thank you.

00:09:16.181 --> 00:09:17.773
- And first of all I love
listening to books on,

00:09:17.773 --> 00:09:19.889
I think that Audible, I
mean, it's kind of like

00:09:19.889 --> 00:09:21.538
podcasts before podcasts, right?

00:09:21.538 --> 00:09:22.986
- Yeah, audiobooks are rad.

00:09:22.986 --> 00:09:25.221
- Yeah, and you get to listen
to the person who wrote it

00:09:25.221 --> 00:09:26.967
