00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.633
- Yeah.

00:09:28.633 --> 00:09:29.466
- Too many authors aren't
reading their book.

00:09:29.466 --> 00:09:30.299
- Yeah, yeah.

00:09:30.299 --> 00:09:32.092
So, I mean, what's the feedback been?

00:09:32.092 --> 00:09:32.989
How's it going?

00:09:32.989 --> 00:09:35.345
- Oh, all time, it's the
greatest audiobook of all time.

00:09:35.345 --> 00:09:36.178
- Yeah.

00:09:36.178 --> 00:09:37.011
- Download it today.

00:09:37.011 --> 00:09:37.844
(laughing)

00:09:37.844 --> 00:09:40.925
I think people love when I go off script.

00:09:40.925 --> 00:09:43.014
I love the opportunity of
updating my own content

00:09:43.014 --> 00:09:45.212
